{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-365e7e7436c1059ff01e3354322207fb21154a11b2bb02a9","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"e6a3ca735820ac953721c8d0402eeab9738b05ccdc087d2a92905c07af94be41","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Form No. 21] <Amended Apr. 5, 2007> (Front)\n\nREPORT OF RETURN OF TAXABLE GOODS AND APPLICATION FOR CERTIFICATION (CERTIFICATE)\n\nProcessing Period: Immediate\n\nReporter\n① Name (Representative): ______________________________\n② Resident (Corporate) Registration No.: ______________________________\n③ Trade Name (Corporate Name): ______________________________\n④ Telephone No.: ______________________________\n⑤ Address (Location of Head Office): ______________________________\n⑥ Location of Manufacturing Place: ______________________________\n⑦ Business Registration No.: ______________________________\n\nReturning Party\n⑧ Name (Representative): ______________________________\n⑨ Trade Name (Corporate Name): ______________________________\n⑩ Place from Which Articles Are Returned: ______________________________\n⑪ Business Registration No.: ______________________________\n\nDetails of Report\n\n| ⑫ Name of Returned Goods | ⑬ Quantity | ⑭ Specification | ⑮ Unit Price | ⑯ Price | ⑰ Tax Amount Paid | ⑱ Remarks |\n|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| | | | | | | |\n\n⑲ Date Shipped Out: ______ year ______ month ______ day\n⑳ Date Returned: ______ year ______ month ______ day\n㉑ Reason for Return: ________________________________________________________________\n\nAs the taxable goods shipped out after taxation have been returned as stated above, I hereby report such return pursuant to Article 17 (2) and (3) of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act and request certification of the fact of return.\n\nDate: ______ year ______ month ______ day\n\nReporter: ______________________________ (Signature or Seal)\n\nTo: Head of the Tax Office\n\nCertificate No.: ____________________\n\nIt is hereby certified that the fact of return stated above is correct.\n\nDate: ______ year ______ month ______ day\n\nHead of the Tax Office (Seal)\n\nTo: ______________________________\n\nRequired Documents: None\nFee: None\n※ This report and application form is distributed free of charge.\n\nPaper: General paper 60g/㎡ (recycled) or newsprint 54g/㎡ (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nPROCESSING PROCEDURE\n\nApplicant\n1. Preparation of Report and Application for Certification\n\nProcessing Agency: Head of the Tax Office Having Jurisdiction over the Business Place\n2. Receipt (Civil Service Office)\n3. Investigation / Confirmation (Responsible Division)\n4. Approval (Delegated Approval by Division Chief)\n5. Preparation of Certificate (Responsible Division)\n\nFlow:\n1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5 → 1\nThe return from step 5 to step 1 is labeled “Delivery of Certificate.”\n\n※ If this report and application form is not submitted, the confirmation of the competent head of the tax office required for a refund or credit of tax under Article 17 (2) of the Traffic Tax Act cannot be obtained.\n\n[Source-structure note: Preserve all 21 numbered fields, the seven-column detail table with one blank input row, the immediate processing period, both Article 17 (2) and (3) references, the five-step processing flow, and the tax-office seal. The final non-submission notice intentionally refers to the older “Traffic Tax Act” source title and is not normalized to the current Act title.]\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\db09525f163d54d89eb56b30bd3e3a2581d73b5453dc39a03ce0b5059cff110b.ascii.json","sha256":"db09525f163d54d89eb56b30bd3e3a2581d73b5453dc39a03ce0b5059cff110b"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"5cd720d0c8f0f6335e4f91702a6dc2407fe9fcce157d2d52d13f4f6cd1189789","unit_key":"form-002100F"}],"source_component_text_sha256":"5cd720d0c8f0f6335e4f91702a6dc2407fe9fcce157d2d52d13f4f6cd1189789","source_law_id":"kr-006574-270243-ko","source_review_complete":true,"source_xml_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","target_body_sha256":"cebbb7f011dcd17ada65744562ebe4d468c7171e368538b4e4a5e00e4a7d1501","unit_key":"form-002100F"},"unit_key":"form-002100F"}],"author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_errata\\concurrent_unit_recoveries_v1\\bc13b0ff03bc426b57fe0db2\\009d2079aaac9d46e616\\recovered_translation\\en.title.json","sha256":"caf0dcf5c50a9f70581ce8b6bff50b953f3d3a7a30a17edbf83172f05b5f4e7e"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_errata\\concurrent_unit_recoveries_v1\\bc13b0ff03bc426b57fe0db2\\009d2079aaac9d46e616\\recovered_translation\\en.units.parts\\form-002100F.json","sha256":"de819c9d186d869de72b7c71f832cc52f26a521df81f40e2979ddf91da6a5e58"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\